<title>UK: TABLE-Camelot yr profit, sales fall.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Camelot yr profit, sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		(million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Total sales		4,723.0		vs 5,217.0</p>
<p> Amount for good causes 1,272.6		vs 1,416.1</p>
<p> Prizes		     2,384.1		vs 2,642.6</p>
<p> Profit after tax	 46.8		   vs 51.1</p>
<p> Retailer commission    242.0		  vs 265.0</p>
<p> Amount payable to govt 610.2		  vs 677.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British national lottery operator is Camelot Group Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
